== 8.7 Chapter 8 Practice Drill — 40 Questions

40 questions graded in the order the CBT engine is likely to meet them. Allow 44 minutes; the key and a full solution for every question follow.

#mcq(1, [A debenture is],
  [a loan to the company],
  [a share in the company],
  [a reserve],
  [a dividend]
)

#mcq(2, [Debenture interest is],
  [a charge against profit],
  [a dividend],
  [an appropriation of profit],
  [paid at the directors' discretion]
)

